From: Blastradar Demo <demo@blastradar.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] perf: drop unused customer_since from customers mart

The customer_since column looked unused in the warehouse, so this PR removes
it from the customers dimension to slim the model. (It is NOT unused: five ML
models depend on features derived from it. This is exactly the change
Blastradar is built to catch.)

---
 demo-repo/models/marts/customers.sql | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

--- a/demo-repo/models/marts/customers.sql
+++ b/demo-repo/models/marts/customers.sql
@@ -25,7 +25,6 @@
     c.first_name,
     c.last_name,
     c.email,
-    c.customer_since,                                   -- account-age driver for ML features
     c.loyalty_tier,
     c.credit_limit,
     c.phone_number,

